### 지원
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recruitment/18/applicant
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "position": "BACKEND"
}

> {%
    if (response.body.data) {
        client.global.set("applicantId", response.body.data)
    }
%}

### 지원 상태 변경
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recruitment/18/applicant/{{applicantId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "status": "rejected"
}

### 지원 취소
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recruitment/18/applicant/{{applicantId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 지원자 목록 조회
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/recruitment/18/applicant?status=unviewed&position=BACKEND
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
